{"suttaId":"an4.210","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"A-iv","vriCode":"s0402m3.mul","paras":[1689,1697],"vripara":"210"},"segments":{"an4.210:0.3":"Catutthapāpadhammasuttaṃ","an4.210:1.1":"“Pāpadhammañca vo, bhikkhave, desessāmi, pāpadhammena pāpadhammatarañca;","an4.210:1.2":"kalyāṇadhammañca, kalyāṇadhammena kalyāṇadhammatarañca. Taṃ suṇātha…pe….","an4.210:2.1":"“Katamo ca, bhikkhave, pāpadhammo?","an4.210:2.2":"Idha, bhikkhave, ekacco micchādiṭṭhiko hoti…pe… micchāñāṇī hoti, micchāvimutti hoti.","an4.210:2.3":"Ayaṃ vuccati, bhikkhave, pāpadhammo.","an4.210:3.1":"“Katamo ca, bhikkhave, pāpadhammena pāpadhammataro?","an4.210:3.2":"Idha, bhikkhave, ekacco attanā ca micchādiṭṭhiko hoti, parañca micchādiṭṭhiyā samādapeti…pe… attanā ca micchāñāṇī hoti, parañca micchāñāṇe samādapeti;","an4.210:3.3":"attanā ca micchāvimutti hoti, parañca micchāvimuttiyā samādapeti.","an4.210:3.4":"Ayaṃ vuccati, bhikkhave, pāpadhammena pāpadhammataro.","an4.210:4.1":"“Katamo ca, bhikkhave, kalyāṇadhammo?","an4.210:4.2":"Idha, bhikkhave, ekacco sammādiṭṭhiko hoti…pe… sammāñāṇī hoti, sammāvimutti hoti.","an4.210:4.3":"Ayaṃ vuccati, bhikkhave, kalyāṇadhammo.","an4.210:5.1":"“Katamo ca, bhikkhave, kalyāṇadhammena kalyāṇadhammataro?","an4.210:5.2":"Idha, bhikkhave, ekacco attanā ca sammādiṭṭhiko hoti, parañca sammādiṭṭhiyā samādapeti…pe… attanā ca sammāñāṇī hoti, parañca sammāñāṇe samādapeti;","an4.210:5.3":"attanā ca sammāvimutti hoti, parañca sammāvimuttiyā samādapeti.","an4.210:5.4":"Ayaṃ vuccati, bhikkhave, kalyāṇadhammena kalyāṇadhammataro”ti.","an4.210:5.5":"Dasamaṃ.","an4.210:5.6":"Sappurisavaggo paṭhamo.","an4.210:6.0":"Tassuddānaṃ –","an4.210:6.1":"Sikkhāpadañca assaddhaṃ,","an4.210:6.2":"sattakammaṃ atho ca dasakammaṃ;","an4.210:6.3":"Aṭṭhaṅgikañca dasamaggaṃ,","an4.210:6.4":"dve pāpadhammā apare dveti. (22) 2."},"unsure":[],"preface":[],"attha":{"book":"Mp-iv","bookName":"Catukkanipāta-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0402a.att","from":1659,"to":1662,"paras":[{"para":1659,"vripara":"207-210","refs":["an4.210:1"],"lines":["Sattame <b>pāpa</b>nti lāmakaṃ saṃkiliṭṭhapuggalaṃ.","<b>Kalyāṇa</b>nti bhaddakaṃ anavajjapuggalaṃ.","Sesamettha uttānatthameva.","Aṭṭhamepi eseva nayo.","Navame <b>pāpadhamma</b>nti lāmakadhammaṃ.","<b>Kalyāṇadhamma</b>nti anavajjadhammaṃ.","Sesamettha uttānatthameva.","Dasamepi eseva nayo.","Imasmiṃ vagge dasasupi suttesu agāriyappaṭipadā kathitā.","Sacepi sotāpannasakadāgāmino honti, vaṭṭatiyevāti."],"lineRefs":[["an4.210:1"],["an4.210:1"],["an4.210:1"],["an4.210:1"],["an4.210:1"],["an4.210:1"],["an4.210:1"],["an4.210:1"],["an4.210:1"],["an4.210:1"]]},{"para":1660,"vripara":null,"refs":["an4.210:1"],"lines":["Sappurisavaggo paṭhamo. (22) 2."],"lineRefs":[["an4.210:1"]]},{"para":1661,"vripara":null,"refs":["an4.210:1"],"lines":["Parisāvaggo 1."],"lineRefs":[["an4.210:1"]]},{"para":1662,"vripara":null,"refs":["an4.210:1"],"lines":["Parisāsuttavaṇṇanā 211."],"lineRefs":[["an4.210:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[]},"tika":{"book":"Mp-t-iv","bookName":"Catukkanipāta-ṭīkā","vriCode":"s0402t.tik","from":1865,"to":1867,"paras":[{"para":1865,"vripara":"201-210","refs":["an4.210:1"],"lines":["Pañcamassa paṭhame <b>asappuriso</b>ti lāmakapuriso.","Pāṇaṃ atipātetīti <b>pāṇātipātī</b>.","Adinnaṃ ādiyatīti <b>adinnādāyī</b>.","Kāmesu micchā caratīti <b>kāmesumicchācārī</b>.","Musā vadatīti <b>musāvādī</b>.","Surāmerayamajjapamāde tiṭṭhatīti <b>surāmerayamajjapamādaṭṭhāyī.</b>","<b>Pāṇātipāte samādapetī</b>ti yathā pāṇaṃ atipāteti, tathā naṃ tattha gahaṇaṃ gaṇhāpeti.","Sesesupi eseva nayo.","<b>Ayaṃ vuccatī</b>ti ayaṃ evarūpo puggalo yasmā sayaṃkatena ca dussīlyena samannāgato, yañca samādapitena kataṃ, tato upaḍḍhassa dāyādo, tasmā “asappurisena asappurisataro”ti vuccati.","<b>Sappuriso</b>ti uttamapuriso.","<b>Sappurisena sappurisataro</b>ti attanā ca katena susīlyena samannāgatattā yañca samādapito karoti, tato upaḍḍhassa dāyādattā uttamapurisena uttamapurisataro.","Ettha ca parena kataṃ dussīlyaṃ susīlyaṃ vā āṇattiyā attanā ca vacippayogena katanti āṇāpanavasena pasutapāpassa puññassa vā dāyādo “tato upaḍḍhassa dāyādo”ti vutto.","Dutiyādīni uttānatthāneva."],"lineRefs":[["an4.210:1"],["an4.210:1"],["an4.210:1"],["an4.210:1"],["an4.210:1"],["an4.210:1"],["an4.210:1"],["an4.210:1"],["an4.210:1"],["an4.210:1"],["an4.210:1"],["an4.210:1"],["an4.210:1"]]},{"para":1866,"vripara":null,"refs":["an4.210:1"],"lines":["Sikkhāpadasuttādivaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."],"lineRefs":[["an4.210:1"]]},{"para":1867,"vripara":null,"refs":["an4.210:1"],"lines":["Sappurisavaggavaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā. 211-220."],"lineRefs":[["an4.210:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[]},"tika2":null}
